      "text": "📣 Traffic Advisory: Gander RCMP is currently responding to a tractor trailer blocking the westbound lane of the Trans-Canada Highway east of Gander, in the area of Square Pond Hill. One lane of traffic is passable but road conditions are hazardous, quickly deteriorating and visibility is low. \n\n⚠️ While the TCH is passable, motorists should expect delays and are asked to drive with extreme caution and patience. \n\nPlease consider delaying any immediate travel. If you must travel, please exercise caution and patience and drive according to road and weather conditions. \n\nRemember — snow means slow! ❄️",
